; The value and step of A and of each of K10 to K1, of each frame in (interp's last 22 cards); for each of the
; frame's ten steps, each K after the step's A, for reduce (A says whether the multiplies round or truncate). Each
; value then moves on by its step. The Ks are kept in cells 70-79 and their steps in 80-89; the instructions that
; reach them are moved on a cell for each K.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frame   INP   a        03-21: a frame: A and its step, then each K and its step
  04                    INP   da
  05                    CLA   i70
  06                    STO   rk
  07                    CLA   i80
  08                    STO   rd
  09            rk      DATA  0        (INP 70 + k)
  10            rd      DATA  0        (INP 80 + k)
  11                    CLA   rk
  12                    ADD   00
  13                    STO   rk
  14                    CLA   rd
  15                    ADD   00
  16                    STO   rd
  17                    SUB   i90
  18                    TAC   rk
  19                    CLA   n9
  20                    STO   s
  21            step    CLA   o70      21-55: a step: A and each K, each K then moved on
  22                    STO   ok
  23                    CLA   c70
  24                    STO   ck
  25                    CLA   a80
  26                    STO   ak
  27                    CLA   s70
  28                    STO   sk
  29            each    OUT   a
  30            ok      DATA  0        (OUT 70 + k)
  31            ck      DATA  0        (CLA 70 + k)
  32            ak      DATA  0        (ADD 80 + k)
  33            sk      DATA  0        (STO 70 + k)
  34                    CLA   ok
  35                    ADD   00
  36                    STO   ok
  37                    CLA   ck
  38                    ADD   00
  39                    STO   ck
  40                    CLA   ak
  41                    ADD   00
  42                    STO   ak
  43                    CLA   sk
  44                    ADD   00
  45                    STO   sk
  46                    SUB   s80
  47                    TAC   each
  48                    CLA   a
  49                    ADD   da
  50                    STO   a
  51                    CLA   s
  52                    SUB   00
  53                    STO   s
  54                    TAC   frame
  55                    JMP   step
  56            a       DATA  0
  57            da      DATA  0
  58            s       DATA  0
  59            n9      DATA  9
  60            i70     INP   70
  61            i80     INP   80
  62            i90     INP   90
  63            o70     OUT   70
  64            c70     CLA   70
  65            a80     ADD   80
  66            s70     STO   70
  67            s80     STO   80
